how to market your workshops if you're  an entrepreneur and you're selling  workshops and you want people to know  about it you want people to call you up  and say come into my school my store my  business whatever it is to learn about  your workshops then today I'm going to  give you three strategies on how to  promote those workshops and it comes on  the back of a question from one of my  readers preacher Jay preacher Jay you  wrote sin to say that he's marking these  workshops trying to teach young people  how to be entrepreneurs and he's  focusing on students and he's trying to  figure out how do I get the word out  about my workshops so preacher Jay here  is my three-step strategy for how to  promote your workshops  the first one is partnerships okay if  you want to go out and promote your  workshops you have to find people who  are willing to showcase them so in your  case that may be schools and maybe  colleges it may be groups you can look  them up online you can go to networking  events you can see where these people  are hanging out and contact them if you  are just trying to build up a list one  of my favorite resources is a website  called jigsaw its jigsaw com  I'm not filling with it but I love the  service we can find names of people  phone numbers email addresses that cost  you about a dollar per lead and you can  reach out to them and say here's what  I'm doing and make sure you're reaching  out to them with something special  something memorable something different  because they're getting pitch a lot by  people just like you so you have to have  a different angle when you're telling me  about your workshops just like you did  in your email and you got to tell me  what's different about it teaching  students to be entrepreneurs it's a  great message but it's not powerful  enough why what's so what's the reason  behind this what do you stand for is it  to get kids off the street is it to  teach people that there's another way  it's not just going to work for a big  company you can start your own thing if  you have to have some passion here  because again these people are being  pitched all the time by people just like  you and to get them to pay attention to  you you have to have a message that is  worth spreading  so work on that message and start  building your list and reaching out to  people ok that's your first step the  second step is getting the media ok if  you are a workshop lead  you're a thought leader you have  something to say you have a powerful  opinion and you should be an expert and  as entrepreneurs we should all be  experts at what we do so what I want you  to do is start building up a list of  media people who are targeting your area  I don't know if you're looking at just  doing it in your city in your state  you're trying to go nationwide whatever  it is wherever you're trying to start  build up a media list and give them  something worth talking about again this  ties to why do people need your workshop  is it that students are struggling and  they're on the street and this is a way  for them to get off of it is it that  young people want to be entrepreneurs  but they don't have enough training in  the schools like what is it what what is  the reason why I need to sign up for  your workshop I shouldn't have to ask  you this question it should be in your  message and you send an email to  somebody it should be a parent what it  is that you do the benefit why I want to  connect with you okay media are always  looking for stores so if you can create  a great story with a hook that promotes  you it's not a sales pitch but it  showcases your expertise it starts to  build awareness and people who are  reading that will see your name will see  your website will say I need to have  that in my school or my college or my  university and they'll contact you it's  such a great way to reach people because  it's not used screaming it's somebody  talking on your behalf right if a  newspaper publishes you it's them saying  hey this is a credible credible person  this is somebody who you should listen  to and it dramatically increases the  chances of people noticing you and it's  not that hard to reach out to the media  and get published the media are looking  for stories constantly they're  constantly looking for experts to give  them content that's their job is to find  great content you're making their job  easier so build your list of reporters  and start reaching it the third thing I  would do is I would start recording the  workshops or recording your message and  get it up online make youtube videos  even if it's something simple just like  I'm doing right now you and talk in  front of a camera it's not even you  doing your workshop it's just you  front of a camera talking to start  building momentum one it'll make you a  better speaker if the more practice you  have the more you go through the  exercise the better you're gonna become  but two it'll help start building a  movement you want people spreading your  stuff you want people talking about you  I've gotten gigs with big companies from  my videos because they see my passion  for entrepreneurs and it could be me  helping them explain how to market to  entrepreneurs  it could be me helping them with the  program it could be me doing a workshop  facilitation creating content for them  whatever it is I've gotten tons of  opportunities from the content I produce  a lot of it to the videos or through the  blog posts that I put up you need to  showcase your expertise and it'll also  help give you a sense of what kind of  content is sticking with people where  you can tell on your videos how many  views they have how many comments they  have are people liking our people  sharing it that can form a great content  base to make your workshops even better  but the main goal here is getting your  message out so for anybody who's  promoting a workshop or anybody who's  trying to showcase themselves as a  thought leader if it's workshops if it's  seminars if it's books if it's being a  radio show if it's doing anything where  you are a thought leader then follow  that process one again reach out to  potential partners people who can  promote you people who can bring you in  and showcase you number two make sure  that you're out there talking to the  media  create a list reach out to them on a  regular basis give them value don't sell  them give them value make them want to  talk about you because you're giving  them a great story with a great hook and  number three start recording yourself  create a YouTube channel start building  momentum start building traction  become a better speaker because you're  practicing more those three steps have  worked for me I've worked for tons of  other experts and I know they're gonna  work for you believe those are you  watching like a video please give it a  thumbs up below it always makes me want  to do more and I'd love to hear we have  to think you have a question about your  business leave it below I'm a good video  response you have a different comment  about this  the on particularly verbal oh I love  Cena's come in thank you so much and  I'll see you soon
 

